WEBVTT

00:00:00.234 --> 00:00:03.634
A speedup you cannot verify is not a result.

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:06.034
Two ranks must equal one process.

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:09.334
Every number traces to a run artifact.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:12.434
2x Tesla T4 on Kaggle. Every row measured.

00:00:14.984 --> 00:00:17.634
fp32 scales at 98%. amp drops to 57%.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.284
Remove the dataloader: back to 96%.

00:00:21.434 --> 00:00:23.434
It was never the GPUs.
